{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e05-scene-04",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "お互い自由に生きましょう  (Let's Live Freely)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "client_f": "女性客",
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While Muranishi films a candid interview with his new star about her past romance, the departing female director returns home to her modest apartment where Kuroki is waiting to start a new life as roommates.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どこで出会ったの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "先輩の先輩で、学園祭に行った時に紹介されまして。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "その彼氏とはどのくらいつきあったんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "三カ月ぐらいかと思います。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうして？別れちゃったの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "なんか彼氏があんまり束縛するんで、イヤになっちゃって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "おかえりなさい。そんなことないわ、ステキなお部屋よ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "なんだか楽しいですわね。トイレのお掃除とかもやりますわよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "シャワーの順番とか洗濯のルールとか決めないとね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "あとごはんは当番制でいっか。まずかったらちゃんと言い合おうね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "いいんです、ここで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "これからはお互い好きなことをして、自由に生きましょう。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どこで出会ったの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where did the two of you meet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "先輩の先輩で、学園祭に行った時に紹介されまして。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He was an upperclassman's friend, and we were introduced at a campus festival.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "その彼氏とはどのくらいつきあったんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How long did you go out with that boyfriend?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "三カ月ぐらいかと思います。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'About three months, I think.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうして？別れちゃったの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened? Did you end up breaking up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "なんか彼氏があんまり束縛するんで、イヤになっちゃって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My boyfriend was way too controlling, so I got fed up with it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "おかえりなさい。そんなことないわ、ステキなお部屋よ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome home. Don't say it's cramped—it's a lovely room.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "なんだか楽しいですわね。トイレのお掃除とかもやりますわよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Somehow this feels so fun. I'll gladly clean the bathroom too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "シャワーの順番とか洗濯のルールとか決めないとね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We'll have to set rules for shower turns and doing the laundry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "あとごはんは当番制でいっか。まずかったらちゃんと言い合おうね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And let's take turns cooking meals. If something tastes bad, let's tell each other honestly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "いいんです、ここで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This place right here is plenty fine for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "これからはお互い好きなことをして、自由に生きましょう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From now on, let's both do what we love and live freely.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どこで出会ったの？",
      "gap": 0.5
